            "heading": "A hidden corner",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Dagenham Church building is at the heart of the original site of Dagenham Village.  It is a quiet part of the district, missed by many locals.  The building has been in continuous use for around 800 years and tells a story of changes over those years.  It contains a Jan van Nost sculpture of Richard Allibone."
            ]
